    "title": "Musk's adjustment for massive colonialism of Mars",
    "text": "Entrepreneur Ilon Musk, the owner of SpaceX and Tesla, has adjusted the forecasts of the mass colonies of Mars and extends the terms of up to 30 years. Regarding this, “news”.\nIn April 2024, Musk said that at least one million people and several million tons of goods will be required for the massive colonists of Mars. He added that people and goods may be delivered for 20 years.\nOne of the social network users in the discussion about the development of the recent planets mentioned this statement of businessmen.\nIdeally, 20 years, but probably closer to 30, Mitch Musk said.\nEarlier, the technology tycoon called the message about the city construction plan on Mars.\nMusk also denied that he volunteered to provide his genetic documents for the resolution of the future of Mars.",
